Description: DESERT OS base system miscellaneous files
 This package contains the basic filesystem hierarchy of a DESERT OS system, and
 several important miscellaneous files, such as /etc/debian_version,
 /etc/host.conf, /etc/issue, /etc/motd, /etc/profile, and others,
 and the text of several common licenses in use on DESERT OS systems.
